  "title": "Dole Mentors Help Students Build Business Skills Through The Solas Project",
  "summary": "Students from George’s Hill Primary School in Dublin gathered at Dole’s corporate headquarters to pitch business ideas they had spent five weeks developing, as part of the Solas Project. The Solas Project is a mentoring programme that helps young students build confidence and develop their business acumen. As a corporate partner to the Solas Project, Dole supports the programme by connecting employee volunteers with students for mentoring. Over the past few weeks, a group of Dole colleagues have",
